$ goodfetch-foxhound browser --help
Manages the browser builds this version pins in the Browser cache

Usage: goodfetch-foxhound browser [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  install  Downloads the builds this version pins into the Browser cache (`GOODFETCH_BROWSERS_PATH`, else Goodfetch home), for CI and images: those named, else every one a Run launches by default, all but `chrome-headless-shell` (`browser.headless_shell`)
  clean    Deletes the builds nothing installed pins, unused for `browser_cache.max_unused_age` and held by no running browser

Options:
      --color <WHEN>  When to colour human output; `auto` colours on a terminal unless `NO_COLOR` is set and not empty [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -h, --help          Print help

